Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She's our opponent?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they jest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can defeat her with my arms in shackles!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.47,0:01:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach these fools\Nto mock me! Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.69,0:01:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back your rage, my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us the beast that dwells within!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen Master Ak-Nahdin behave\Nthis way, Bringing harm upon the innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.81,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew she wouldn't fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told this child possesses the\Nmost powerful creature ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So why does she not call it\Nforth to protect herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.45,0:01:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That light!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.97,0:01:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's blinding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.35,0:01:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now finish her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's wasted enough of my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I must see her power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does she hesitate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.67,0:02:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she is not who I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.99,0:02:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I cannot allow this\Nmadness to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Almighty duo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight, then fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.07,0:02:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You are safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.87,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Call off your beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a lot of nerve\Nshowing your face here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.13,0:02:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the reason we were forced to\Nlive in this dungeon in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us show this sacred guardian how\Nthings are done below the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, for the last time, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.35,0:02:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh's servant wants to be a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So who are we to stand in his way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Seto! Save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave me with no\Nchoice! Then let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.47,0:03:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Duos, or a sword attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.31,0:03:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm slipping!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on to me with all your might!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.47,0:03:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid my soul has been spared\Nfrom the shadows thanks to my creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, however, won't be so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, my beast,\Nfor its feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sektor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your journey to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.91,0:03:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.19,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The creature I saw when I was a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the white dragon with the blue eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought it was only a myth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you must use\Nyour power to protect us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.35,0:04:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the work of the Egyptian gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,See that she gets some rest, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what\Nwe now hold in our hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl wields a beast\Nwith enough power to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.09,0:05:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,annihilate Bakura's deer\Nbound with one blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we would need\Nto take it from her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,which would mean sealing\Nher soul away in stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.53,0:05:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So I would say...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your emotions\Ncloud your reason, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl is your key to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.59,0:05:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We already have a pharaoh, and I\Nintend to find him, not replace him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it he lost his\Nspirit in the pit of shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And Egypt cannot survive without a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what's right for your\Ncountry and take the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to listen to\Nanother word of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.09,0:05:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You have disgraced the name of the\Npharaoh, and I won't be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My place is beside the\Nthrone, not upon the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I locate the pharaoh,\Nthat is where I shall stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you will not seize your destiny,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,then I have no choice but\Nto seize it for you, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Millennium Stone,\NI give you two offerings
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.23,0:06:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh's Puzzle. A treasure around\Nwhich the other Millennium Items revolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This I obtained from the King of Egypt\Nhimself Once I cast him to the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,that is And next I offer up to you a\Npersonal favorite of mine The Millennium Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,it's working as soon as all seven\Nmillennium items are returned to their
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,final resting place the doorway between\Nthis realm and the world beyond will be
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,unlocked only then can zork the dark one\Nbe released the very being who created
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the shadow realm eons ago will return to\Nenvelop and set up the world in darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done to anger you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Akura, find me the Eighth Key!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is the Eighth Key?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.57,0:07:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eighth Key?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What could he have meant by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,When the pharaoh defeated Zork,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,he couldn't destroy the\Ndarkness, so he locked it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to\Nresurrect this beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and for centuries only the\Npharaoh knew the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And that do-gooder didn't tell us so!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I thought I'd figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression that\Nthe secret to unlocking the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,darkness is to return the seven\Nmillennium items to this stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But apparently there's another element.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,An eighth key, the identity of which\Nexists only in the pharaoh's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, his majesty\Nwiped his own memory clean,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,so now not even he knows the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.51,0:08:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It was in front of me the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The eighth key!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was removed from that tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, I beg you,\Ndo not let go of Bobasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever thought\Nabout a trip to the gym?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucci, Lucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what? Bobasa? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Nile River.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So refreshing. So thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think we'll\Nnever find the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling he's somewhere\Nalong this river, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on, a guy\Nneeds food and water, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.09,0:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of food and water, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Masha, whatever you\Ndo, do not do a cannonball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I have what it takes\Nto be an elite spell caster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need a little more practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.33,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Down low!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,To the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Practice does make perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.61,0:10:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,From river, lake, sea, or\Npond, fish obey my magic wand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's back to the spell book.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to do this\Nwithout Master Mahat to guide me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.97,0:10:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it, guys. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.55,0:10:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you, my king?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You shrunk, and you're\Ndressed in strange clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I love this outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.57,0:10:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's safe to assume she sees us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be like Bobasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobasa's been a very busy man, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were making small\Ntalk, I was catching big fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.53,0:11:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be searching\Nfor the pharaoh, not for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a clue, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that looks just\Nlike the pharaoh's cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.59,0:11:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was floating in the\NNile next to my lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, there wouldn't happen to have\Nbeen a person attached to it, was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but there was some\Nyummy fish next to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop thinking\Nwith your stomach for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The important thing is we found\Nsomething of the pharaoh's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.01,0:11:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he must be around\Nhere somewhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.93,0:11:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not the pharaoh, then this\Nmust mean that the king is missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.81,0:11:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We just said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it takes me a\Nlittle while to catch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help us look for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming you and the\Npharaoh are friends, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, he's my closest friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.41,0:11:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too, the poor guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know that we're gonna find him soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're his friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:11:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, we all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The four of us have been pals\Nwith the Pharaoh for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pretty long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about it on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.37,0:12:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.05,0:12:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it they're not friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are a lot of things,\Nbut friendly's not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So you five promise you're\Nfriends with the Pharaoh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you're my friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There'll be plenty of\Ntime to explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My king!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.65,0:12:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shaddaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,our men have combed the entire desert,\Nand there's still no sign of his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what more we can do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He is out there, and we shall find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We have picked up Bacora's trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.83,0:13:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Speria.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.09,0:13:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be helping\NIsis locate the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you see what we cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.13,0:13:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.41,0:13:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in Wakura's hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.41,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a history\Nlesson about your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He destroyed my village\Nwhen he fashioned the seven
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,millennium items in a selfish attempt\Nto further his own power. Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,he went on to lie to\Neveryone about how he planned
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,to use the items to\Nrestore peace and harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I knew better than to be\Nfooled by a ruthless dictator like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.55,0:14:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All your king really desired was power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to control the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Could his words be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did my father really bring\Nharm to innocent people
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to create the\Nseven millennium items?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did he rule justly and\Nrestore peace to Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I remembered more about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great blessing\Nthis day has brought us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,For unto you is born the new\Nprince of Egypt, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.39,0:14:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And one day he shall lead us as pharaohs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's no need to cry, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, everyone falls once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what makes us stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Must I go with you, father?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something you\Nneed to witness, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so dark down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You needn't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This sanctuary is protected by\Nthe Egyptian gods themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you show your\Nrespect, nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,will harm you no i won't\Ngo any further this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,is not a matter of choice father wait stay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,close and be aware of\Nyour surroundings at all
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,times
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,lift yourself up my boy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,who are all these people\Npharaohs that came before
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Egyptian gods, hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have committed a crime beyond\Natonement, and for this I am truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,By bringing the seven millennium items\Ninto this world, I have destroyed the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,lives of thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.49,0:16:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I bear full responsibility\Nfor these actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, spare my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,not punish him for the\Nmisdeeds of his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.57,0:16:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:16:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it you're crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My son, fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You are safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My father surrendered his\Nown safety to ensure my...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I am he who is known as Hassan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to warn you of\Nan impending danger, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork, the Dark One, will soon awaken, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Zork?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The embodiment of pure darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me what I can do to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time is right, you will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I must warn the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall protect all that my\Nfather struggled to build
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Dad. Yes, now pull right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.31,0:18:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, my boy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so cool. I've never met\Na real magician before, Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.15,0:18:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really only half a magician considering\Nonly half of my spells actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.09,0:18:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, back where I come from, there's\Nthis card game called Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've never heard of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.85,0:18:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's this character in the\Ngame that looks just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying I'm a character?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Dark Magician Girl,\Nand she's really powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet if you keep practicing your\Nspells, you can be just as strong as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, you never told us your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I'm thinking about changing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you guys think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:19:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you would like to\Npractice your spellcasting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.27,0:19:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,by conjuring up an\Nenormous sardine sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.19,0:19:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the pickles, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you watch where\Nyou're going, you big oaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.09,0:19:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, use your brake lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that... Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet it is, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, a long time no see,\Nyou king of Egypt yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.19,0:19:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, man? Hi, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we standing here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to see you!
